Social Media Performance Analysis
Aim

To analyze social media performance using shares, engagement rate, impressions, and likes.

1. Post with Highest Shares

Post 9, which was a YouTube Short Video, received the highest number of shares.

Total Shares: 420

2. Engagement Rate

A new column called “Engagement Rate” was created.

The formula used was:

Engagement Rate = (Likes + Comments + Shares) ÷ Impressions

The engagement rates were:

