A bar chart can be created from this Pivot Table to compare total impressions and total likes for each platform.

Result

The analysis shows that Post 9 (YouTube Short Video) had the highest number of shares with 420 shares. Engagement rate was calculated for every post, and the Pivot Table was used to compare the total impressions and likes of each social media platform.
